{"title": "Resilient: Wisdom", "pageid": 22759, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Resilient:_Wisdom", "categories": ["Passive features", "Applies to Wild Shape"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Resilient.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Resilient.webp/300px-Resilient.webp, /w/images/3/35/Resilient.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Resilient.webp/300px-Resilient.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Resilient.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Resilient: Wisdom</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Resilient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resilient\">Resilient</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. You gain a +1 to your <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> and can add your proficiency bonus to your Wisdom <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<ul><li>You increase your <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li>\n<li>Gain <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in Wisdom <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Resilient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resilient\">Resilient</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202501\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 460/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1774/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1076/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 73/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 645181/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   23.894      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   23.894      1 -total\n 18.44%    4.407      1 Template:PageSeo\n 17.22%    4.114      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.03%    3.830      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 14.27%    3.411      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  8.63%    2.062      3 Template:IfEmpty\n  6.73%    1.607      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n  5.32%    1.272      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n  1.32%    0.316      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:22759-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202501 and revision id 168540. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}